     "speaker": "narrator",
     "text": "Hell, the lowest pit. The ground pulses violet. Something enormous breathes in the dark."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "enemy",
     "text": "Kakarot... Where is Kakarot?",
     "effects": [
      "aura_on"
     ]
    },
    {
     "speaker": "player2",
     "text": "He is not here, Broly. There is only us."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "enemy",
     "text": "Then... you will do... until he comes."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "narrator",
     "text": "The Malice swirls into Broly's chest like water down a drain. His hair flares gold, then green, then green shot through with violet.",
     "effects": [
      "flash"
     ]
    },
    {
     "speaker": "enemy",
     "text": "KAKAROTTTTT!",
     "effects": [
      "charge_on",
      "big_shake"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "win": [
    {
     "speaker": "enemy3",
     "text": "...Kakarot...?",
     "effects": [
      "aura_off"
     ]
    },
    {
     "speaker": "narrator",
     "text": "The violet drains out of Broly all at once, hissing into the rock. He sits down heavily, like a child after a tantrum."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "player2",
     "text": "That was the hardest fight I have had in a thousand years. And I have been dead for most of them."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "player2",
     "text": "{name}. You have earned it. I will teach you, the Hyper Tornado, the Thunder Flash, all of it. Hell's champion does not say that lightly."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "enemy3",
     "text": "...Hungry."
    }
   ],
   "lose": [
    {
     "speaker": "enemy3",
     "text": "Not Kakarot... Next..."
    }
   ],
